Subject: [PATCH] Storefront redesign part 2: checkout, order tracking, games,
 category, about, contact

- Checkout rebuilt; fixes summary that hid the setup fee and under-quoted the total
- Order tracking rebuilt with explicit state per status (was showing 'Your Server Is Ready!'
  for cancelled/expired/approved orders) and a progress tracker; payment account numbers now styled
  (view used an undefined brand-400 colour)
- Games and category pages share a spec-table partial
- About and Contact rewritten: removed invented datacenters, hardware, bandwidth/DDoS figures,
  fake SLA, member counts and placeholder address; use real SEO settings and live monitor data
- Share $seo via view composer (child views render before the layout)
- Region picker built from config
